00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>こわして　タントツゴール</i>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>走りつづけてないと</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.650
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>他に意味はないと</i>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>パンクな哲学なんだ</i>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.980
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>バイオリズムは　ツーバイリズムで</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>風景は　瞬間に　無数の線</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.540
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>俺を取り巻く風</i>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside 攻めて</i>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>いっさいがっさい　抜いて</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<i>誰ひとりも　何ひとつも</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>前を　行かせたくはない</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>いっさいがっさい Yes! SONIC!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>アブナイヨと Have A Nice は似てる</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>そう　どちらも紙一重なのさ</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>タイクツ脱ぎ捨てて　今すぐかけだせ</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:41.780
Of all the seeds, she's the only one that survived?

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:45.370
Yes. The others died during the growth process.

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:48.370
The genetic replication process continues to deteriorate.

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:49.880
At this rate...

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:53.880
Earthia is physically past her limits.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:58.220
She's barely surviving by using artificial planet energy.

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:01.800
Don't cry.

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:05.310
We have to name her.

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:06.680
Cosmo.

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:14.230
My final child...

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:21.870
The last hope of saving the universe.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:38.590
What is that?

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.850
Mother...

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:54.210
Episode 77

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:54.210
For Your Sake, I Can Do It

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:01.240
Planet Egg energy is rising rapidly!

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:03.120
It's immeasurable!

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.030
This is bad!

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:07.250
Energy for forestation is intensifying!

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:16.630
Shadow!

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.130
Chris.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:24.850
Here we go!

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:27.010
Ring Road!

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:28.520
Sonic!

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:53.710
Amy!

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.040
Sonic!

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:59.550
Ouch...

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.270
I brought them.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.520
They're useless in this state.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:22.280
Are the Chaos Emeralds dead?

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:27.410
You must be kidding! We even sacrificed the Master Emerald!

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.040
It can't end like this!

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:31.830
Eggman!

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:40.210
If I pour my remaining energy into the Chaos Emeralds, there's a chance that they'll regain their power.

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.670
Dr. Eggman!

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:25.630
What's wrong?

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.560
I feel weak...

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:36.690
Everyone!

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:46.700
His light is absorbing our life energy.

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:50.370
I feel sick.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:56.000
He's even absorbing energy from robots. He's crazy.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.540
I'm finished.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:03.590
He absorbs all forms of energy and transforms them into forests.

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:06.510
This is the final stage of forestation.

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:14.560
Cosmo?

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:21.690
This light doesn't affect me because we're the same species.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.690
Leave it to me.

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:26.940
Cosmo!

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:43.790
If I bring them to Eggman, he can regenerate their power.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:50.340
I have faith that animals and plants will coexist someday.

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:54.890
There will be a day when we can live together in the same world!

00:06:55.810 --> 00:07:00.230
Just like how I was able to become friends with them!

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:07.110
Dark Oak, I know you were watching.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:12.160
We're doing whatever we can to survive this journey.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:16.160
What we're doing isn't evil.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:20.210
Even if we're foolish, make mistakes and struggle...

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:24.340
...as long as we're alive, we can always try again!

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.800
That's an illusion.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:40.690
Losers continue to hope in vain!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.980
We're not hoping!

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:46.570
We're running!

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:50.070
We're running towards the future!

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:52.950
We'll never give up!

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.180
Cosmo!

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:26.480
The Chaos Emeralds!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.260
What's happening?

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.420
This light...

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.810
It's the Planet Eggs.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:06.810
The planets' stolen lives are responding to the Chaos Emeralds.

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:12.400
They responded to our hearts...

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:27.790
The pain is gone.

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.710
Sonic...

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:38.760
Shadow.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.850
Can you hear it?

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:50.610
Yeah, I hear it.

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:18.010
Cosmo!

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:33.980
Sonic... Shadow...

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:59.970
They did it!

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.640
Not quite!

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:21.410
The universe still refuses to give up on hope?

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:26.200
Then I will perform your last rites!

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:30.500
I will end this foolish and immature universe!

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.960
His energy is greatly increasing!

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:38.670
What's going on?

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:46.890
He's compressing the Planet Eggs at his core to create a powerful gravitational force.

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:48.930
What does that mean?

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:54.150
It's like squeezing an inflated balloon.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:57.280
The balloon can't survive for long.

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:58.990
The balloon pops!

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:01.950
So what happens if that explodes?

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:03.780
The universe will...

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:05.830
...be destroyed.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:12.750
You're actually going to do this?

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:41.400
Dr. Eggman, can't you do anything?

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:46.740
I have one final plan. Decoe and Bocoe!

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:52.960
There's a self-destruct device in each of your bodies.

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:55.750
It's now time to use them!

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:58.670
I can't do that, Dr. Eggman!

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:04.220
There's no way our attacks will work when the super duo can't hurt him!

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:05.550
That's right!

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:08.720
Umm, Dr. Eggman?

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:14.230
To be honest, there's nothing we can do.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:17.610
Don't give up! You said you're a scientific genius!

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:22.780
That's right! We can't let the universe end!

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:28.830
Shadow!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:32.620
Don't use that until the final moment.

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.500
Everyone, can you hear me?

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.500
Gather all the energy you have left.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:47.470
Use the remaining energy to launch me using the Sonic Driver!

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:49.800
We can't do that, Sonic!

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:53.680
Since you're in Super mode, you're already overtaxing your body!

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:56.100
If we launch you using the Sonic Driver...

00:13:56.100 --> 00:14:03.070
Besides, there's no guarantee that the Sonic Driver will work against that powerful energy wall!

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:07.780
So there's a chance that not only will we fail to defeat him, but Sonic will die?

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:10.950
We can't do this! Let's think of another way!

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:15.450
Even if the odds are slim, we should still try.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:18.120
Don't worry!

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:20.460
I promise I'll be back.

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:23.920
You promise.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:25.460
Yeah!

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:30.760
Connecting all remaining bypasses to Sonic Driver!

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:34.850
We have 163 rings remaining. I'm sending them all to the compression chamber!

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:37.520
We're past the target energy level!

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:41.900
Cutting electric power! Sending all energy to the Sonic Driver!

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:53.330
Dr. Eggman, will everything turn out okay?

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:56.000
Super Sonic will win, right?

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:01.830
Please!

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:04.000
Mother...

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.090
Cosmo...

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:10.640
You can do it.

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:15.680
Just like how I devoted myself to this ship...

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:18.560
Only I can do it.

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:20.560
Cosmo?

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:29.070
Please tell everyone to defeat him and create a future full of freedom.

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:31.160
Cosmo?

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:36.660
Cosmo!

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:04.730
Cosmo is...

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.770
Cream?

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:11.110
Cosmo is...

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.040
Cosmo?

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:34.340
Mother, I now know what's important to me.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:43.730
There's something that I want to protect. That's why I'm going.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.660
Cosmo?

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:49.130
With my body as a conduit, you can now attack Dark Oak.

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:53.510
Please shoot me.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:58.050
She fused with Dark Oak.

00:17:58.050 --> 00:17:59.800
Cosmo...

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:03.350
She's intending to die?

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:05.730
Dr. Eggman...

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:11.940
If we pull them apart, his compressed energy will immediately explode.

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:16.360
Besides, once a member of her tribe reaches maturity...

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:20.950
...she withers and dies.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:23.830
No... He's lying, right?

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:28.210
We can't let it end like this!

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:33.250
There must be some other way to save Cosmo and stop Dark Oak!

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:35.010
Chris!

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.300
Sorry...

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:40.430
What are you talking about?

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:43.060
You're going to let Cosmo die?

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:43.930
Well, Tails?

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:45.180
That's enough!

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:48.100
You're not the only one in pain!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:52.730
We all feel the same!

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:55.690
Everyone...

00:18:56.490 --> 00:19:01.950
Sorry, but can you leave me alone?

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:33.020
Tails, we're starting. We don't have much time left.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:38.610
Connecting energy to the cannon's hammer.

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:51.500
Pressurizing the cannon rod's ring energy.

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:02.260
Sonic, start your spin!

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:21.700
The energy is rising rapidly!

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:24.910
The power is incredible!

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:31.160
Shadow...

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.420
Sonic Driver!

00:20:37.550 --> 00:20:39.010
Fire!

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:43.010
Fire!

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:56.480
I can't do it...

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:00.030
I don't want to...

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:02.570
I don't want to, Cosmo...

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:05.320
You promised!

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:13.120
You promised that when it's all over, you would live with us on our planet!

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:20.130
Tails, are you going to let her sacrifice go to waste?

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:25.640
I can't do it. I can't shoot her.

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:35.190
Since you've traveled together, you must know how she feels to make this sacrifice.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:46.410
I do, but I can't!

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:48.490
Tails...

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:54.410
I'm sorry that I keep troubling you to the very end.

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:57.880
Cosmo...

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:03.760
You never caused me any trouble!

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:12.100
I want you to shoot me, Tails.

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:18.060
I can't!

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:25.570
Because...

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:36.210
Cosmo, I...

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:47.360
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:47.360
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:47.360 --> 00:22:56.330
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:47.360 --> 00:22:56.330
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:22:56.330 --> 00:23:05.230
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:22:56.330 --> 00:23:05.230
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:05.230 --> 00:23:15.160
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:05.230 --> 00:23:15.160
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:12.910 --> 00:23:16.290
Tails, thank you.

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:24.380
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:24.380
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:24.500
I'll never forget you.

00:23:24.380 --> 00:23:33.720
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:24.380 --> 00:23:33.720
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:24.500 --> 00:23:29.010
We had fun, didn't we?

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:39.350
For some reason, the only thing I can remember is everyone's smiling faces.

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:43.630
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:43.630
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:43.630 --> 00:23:51.700
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:43.630 --> 00:23:51.700
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:43.900 --> 00:23:45.440
Cosmo...

00:23:45.940 --> 00:23:47.570
Tails...

00:23:52.040 --> 00:23:56.490
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:52.040 --> 00:23:56.490
<i>Forever...</i>

00:23:56.950 --> 00:23:58.910
I love you.

00:24:30.720 --> 00:25:22.690
The Place where Planets are Born
